# Run artifacts. Results are generated, but the small canonical ones are
# committed so that the reports can be rebuilt, and verified by the dash gate,
# on a machine with no GPU. That is what the continuous integration report job
# depends on. Everything here is a few kilobytes of text.
snapshots/
experiments/results/*
!experiments/results/.gitkeep
!experiments/results/benchmarks.csv
!experiments/results/tile_sweep.csv
!experiments/results/device.json
!experiments/results/validation_gates.csv
!experiments/results/profile_summary.csv
!experiments/results/energy_drift_two_body.csv
!experiments/results/momentum_drift_plummer.csv
!experiments/results/plummer_radial_density.csv
*.bin
diagnostics*.csv

